  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earthquake Crisis Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On the night of September 8, a 6.8 magnitude earthquake hit the High Atlas region where all our boarding houses are located. There has been significant damage to all of our houses. We are now trying to get updates from the girls who were back in their villages. In addition to repairing our houses, we anticipate emergency and longer-term support for the girls and their families. Any help you can give at this time will be gratefully received.</narrative>
  </description>
